        "description": "One PrettyLittleThing product by code or link: name, brand, description, details and care, features, attributes (category, style, department, gender, collection, length, occasion, design), badges, breadcrumbs, categories, colours and every size variant with its SKU, price, was price, discounts, stock flag, stock quantity, EAN and images, plus `raw`.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/prettylittlething-product",
